\f1\i (2)CLIENT AND SERVER WITH ONE REAL LIFE EXAMPLE:\
.CLIENT: 
\f3\i0 A client is a device or application that sends a request for information\
                 or services.
\f1\i \
.
\f2\i0 SERVER:
\f3  A server is a computer or system that receives the request and sends back the \
                   required data.\

\f2 \
.EXAMPLE: 
\f3 When you open YouTube on your phone,your phone is the client, and \
                        Youtube\'92s computers are the servers that send the videos.\
\

